 "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_1051926943907212_2110796268171041497_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tSDgzusxRW4Q7kNvwFov3AR&_nc_oc=AdqKbdFDLAY_AZqLKaD6LEjX786ePTt1QTq1IkaW6nuXTW5O0BCwboYSsqNmz5nao_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKoGB9_HG6kSQAH77hQKu0duuYnK4_YrNvlsCsrxmdVaA&oe=6A9C14BA"}, "display_name": "Brain Coffee", "keywords": ["cafe", "energia", "enfoque", "motivacion", "bienestar"], "long_description": "Step into the most exclusive coffee house in the universe: your own. Brain Coffee VR is a premium wellness & entertainment experience\nfor Meta Quest. A black-and-gold futuristic lounge where the coffee ritual\nbecomes audiovisual sessions of energy, focus and motivation \u2014 rhythmic\nmusic, a guiding voice, golden steam, and a holographic brain that lights up\nwith your progress.\n\u2615 DOUBLE ESPRESSO \u2014 YOUR ENERGY PROGRAM\nTen professionally mixed audio tracks in English and Spanish: five deep\nsessions (Morning Ritual, The Grind, Extraction, Aroma & Memory, Energy &\nFocus) plus five 5-minute quick shots for when you need a boost right now.\nMusic, positive affirmations and rhythmic pulses, mixed for the headset.\n\ud83e\udde0 A BRAIN THAT PULSES WITH YOU\nOur holographic visualizer \u2014 an artistic representation, not a medical one \u2014\ngoes from dormant bronze to radiant gold as your session builds, beating in\nsync with the music.\n\u26a1 POWERS STAGE\nSome sessions wake up the caf\u00e9's electric side: surprise visual effects at\nthe center of the stage, different every time.\n\ud83d\udc9b COFFEE DATE WITH VALENTINA\nFive minutes of virtual company: Valentina walks in, sits at your table and\nchats with you \u2014 hundreds of voiced lines with subtitles, facial\nexpressions, blinking and natural gaze. A warm way to end the day.\n\ud83c\udfc6 YOUR 4-WEEK PLAN\nA consistency calendar, streaks, accumulated minutes and the Brain Caf\u00e9\nCommunity. Everything is stored locally on your headset.\nFeatures\n100% comfortable: fully enjoyable seated,", "short_description": "Your futuristic brain caf\u00e9: energy & focus sessions, golden beats, a\nholographic brain \u2014 and a coffee date with Valentina."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1206224115025209", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Brain Coffee", "keywords": ["cafe", "relajacion"], "long_description": "Entra a la cafeter\u00eda m\u00e1s exclusiva del universo: la tuya.\nVirtual Brain Coffee VR es una experiencia premium de bienestar y\nentretenimiento para Meta Quest. Un lounge futurista en negro y oro donde el ritual del caf\u00e9 se convierte en sesiones audiovisuales de energ\u00eda, enfoque y motivaci\u00f3n \u2014 con m\u00fasica r\u00edtmica, voz gu\u00eda, vapor dorado y un cerebro hologr\u00e1fico que se enciende con tu progreso.\n\u2615 EXPRESO DOBLE \u2014 TU PROGRAMA DE ENERG\u00cdA\nDiez pistas de audio profesionales en espa\u00f1ol e ingl\u00e9s: cinco sesiones\nprofundas (Ritual de Ma\u00f1ana, Molienda, Extracci\u00f3n, Aroma y Memoria, Energ\u00eda y\nEnfoque) y cinco refuerzos r\u00e1pidos de 5 minutos para cuando necesitas un\nimpulso ya. M\u00fasica, afirmaciones positivas y pulsos r\u00edtmicos, todo mezclado\npara el visor.\n\ud83e\udde0 UN CEREBRO QUE LATE CONTIGO\nNuestro visualizador hologr\u00e1fico \u2014una representaci\u00f3n art\u00edstica, no m\u00e9dica\u2014\npasa de bronce dormido a oro radiante conforme avanza tu sesi\u00f3n, latiendo al\nritmo de los beats.\n\u26a1 ESCENARIO DE PODERES\nAlgunas sesiones despiertan el lado m\u00e1s el\u00e9ctrico del caf\u00e9: efectos visuales\nsorpresa en el centro del escenario, distintos cada vez.\n\ud83d\udc9b CITA DE CAF\u00c9 CON VALENTINA\nCinco minutos de compa\u00f1\u00eda virtual: Valentina entra caminando, se sienta a tu\nmesa y platica contigo \u2014 cientos de frases con voz, subt\u00edtulos, expresiones\nfaciales, parpadeo y mirada natural. Un momento c\u00e1lido para cerrar el d\u00eda.\n\ud83c\udfc6 TU PLAN DE 4 SEMANAS\nCalendario de constancia, rachas, minutos acumulados y la Comunidad Brain\nCaf\u00e9. Todo se guarda localmente en tu ", "short_description": "Tu caf\u00e9 cerebral futurista: sesiones de energ\u00eda y enfoque, beats dorados, un cerebro hologr\u00e1fico y una cita de caf\u00e9 con Valentina.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/94b69974-999a-48ea-8b60-89f4e149937d", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Francisco Manuel Mier y Ter\u00e1n Almaz\u00e1n", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/94b69974-999a-48ea-8b60-89f4e149937d", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1103050512161051"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312267_1392357812817045_5259689386291447754_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TJAVICCv9loQ7kNvwE0p3_X&_nc_oc=AdrMdRG6WK5WsPlQBeZ5Y3737VazV8aPP02HpS7JaZKsOqPK1Vxpf1sGb9f6mGIuyk8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI8D3a7H_6WMg97yICdeOV0gQCDAUzqldPS9eQViyV7WA&oe=6A9C3017"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Brain C